  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve03",
      "hash64": "1B951F30F6EA9DD4",
      "text": "听说洛托姆进入微波炉\\n就会变成加热洛托姆！\\r\\n而且还会改变属性呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve05",
      "hash64": "1B951D30F6EA9A6E",
      "text": "听说还有会拟态成水果的宝可梦哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve06",
      "hash64": "1B951C30F6EA98BB",
      "text": "吃饭提升食力！\\n会不会也能提升成绩呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve07",
      "hash64": "1B951B30F6EA9708",
      "text": "还没吃呢我就想再来一碗啦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve13",
      "hash64": "1B919F30F6E78E7D",
      "text": "两个人做的三明治，\\n一起吃会更好吃呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve14",
      "hash64": "1B919830F6E78298",
      "text": "在三明治中加入水果\\n也会很好吃呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve18",
      "hash64": "1B919430F6E77BCC",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve19",
      "hash64": "1B919530F6E77D7F",
      "text": "听说在别的地区流行着\\n一种叫咖喱饭的食物……\\r\\n你吃过咖喱饭吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve20",
      "hash64": "1B9C0E30F6F09F9F",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en01",
      "hash64": "8777D1A0A0A0094D",
      "text": "冰箱的旁边\\n出人意料地热～啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en02",
      "hash64": "8777CEA0A0A00434",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en03",
      "hash64": "8777CFA0A0A005E7",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en04",
      "hash64": "8777CCA0A0A000CE",
      "text": "学生食堂总是很热闹啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en05",
      "hash64": "8777CDA0A0A00281",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en09",
      "hash64": "8777C9A0A09FFBB5",
      "text": "喝下午茶时有宝可梦陪着，\\n会是段优雅的时光呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en10",
      "hash64": "877B36A0A0A2EAC3",
      "text": "晚上喝茶也是\\n别有一番情调啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
